zed-tsrs

This extension adapts the repository scaffold and language-server integration
patterns from zed-extensions/tsgo, distributed under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/zed-extensions/tsgo

Modified for the independent, tsrs language server: extension metadata,
binary overrides, pinned native installation, settings, tests and documentation.
The original Apache-2.0 license is retained in LICENSE.

Managed tsrs packages are separate third-party software. Their bundled licenses
and notices are retained with the complete packages in the installation cache.
